{
  "schema": "vpv-tiers/1",
  "updated": "2026-10-24",
  "slots_file": "docs/design/slots.json",
  "notes": [
    "The VP-V Config section's data table (owner 2026-10-24: one VP-V master section, sub-pages per unit, global tier + 'Fallbacks engaged').",
    "tools/gen_vpv_tiers.py turns this file + slots.json into src/VideoProcessor-Config/vpv/VpvTierTable.generated.h; '--check' fails when the header is stale or a slot/key reference is wrong.",
    "Tier keys live in the RENDERER PROFILE section (vprenderer / vprenderer.<name>); no new renderer key stores a tier: the tier is read back from the key values (slider scheme: keep the underlying keys).",
    "A unit lists only the tiers it can really distinguish today (owner: fewer tiers where a unit lacks the granularity). The global tier maps to each unit's highest listed tier at or below it; 'planned_tiers' are shown as 'not yet implemented'.",
    "'set' keys define AND write a tier. 'on_enter' keys are written only when the current value equals 'from' (e.g. leaving Classic restores the default motion taste); they never decide which tier is shown.",
    "'taste' keys (the motion slider) are never greyed in upstream pages; 'managed' keys are greyed there with 'managed by VP-V' while the VP-V pathway is on.",
    "Defaults are the renderer's built-in values when the key is absent (LibplaceboVideoRenderer / RendererProfileConfig parsers, checked 2026-10-24)."
  ],
  "vpv_section": {
    "section": "vpv",
    "pathway_key": "pipeline_original_pathway",
    "pathway_values": [
      "off",
      "on"
    ],
    "pathway_default": "off",
    "expert_keys": [
      "pipeline_order",
      "pipeline_slots_off",
      "calibration_lut_stage"
    ],
    "note": "[vpv] holds VP-V's global (not per-profile) keys; the renderer reads them there first (then [vprenderer], the skeleton's original place). pipeline_original_pathway on = the Original pathway (every VP addition off, ADR-0019); absent/off = the VP-V pathway."
  },
  "delay": {
    "section": "queue",
    "key": "target_latency_ms",
    "recommended_frames": 4,
    "ladder": [
      4,
      3,
      2
    ],
    "note": "Owner 2026-10-24: ONE total delay, the same at every frame rate (padded); 4 queued frames recommended (about 250 ms at 24p); lower settings fall back to 3/2 frames with every feature still working."
  },
  "defaults": {
    "optical_flow": "on",
    "motion_ahead_frames": "4",
    "interpolation": "off",
    "interpolation_fill_gaps": "on",
    "dejudder_est_split": "off",
    "dejudder_est_qpel": "on",
    "dejudder_estimate_ahead": "on",
    "dejudder_strength": "0",
    "dejudder_strength_even": "0",
    "render_ahead": "off",
    "dither_vectors": "auto",
    "deband_vp": "off",
    "deband_vp_grain_guard": "on",
    "deband_vp_exclusive": "on",
    "texture_restore": "off",
    "detail_pulse_stabilise": "on",
    "detail_pulse_fast": "on",
    "source_resolution": "auto",
    "rebase_kernel_match": "on",
    "adaptive_downscale": "off",
    "adaptive_w_base": "1.0",
    "adaptive_faithful": "auto",
    "temporal_dither": "auto",
    "capture_path": "gpu",
    "capture_upload": "auto",
    "native_rgb_ingest": "on",
    "dv_tunnel_gpu_unpack": "off",
    "preserve_extended_range": "on",
    "sdr_tone_shape": "off"
  },
